  "notable_quotes": [
    "CPF-13 shows 81 cm3/g (3.62 mmol/g) CO2 uptake at 298 K and 1 atm, reported as the highest among known charged porous frameworks under ambient conditions.",
    "CPF-13 has low CH4 uptake, 0.11 mmol/g at 0.1 bar and 0.98 mmol/g at 1 bar, giving CO2/CH4 uptake ratios of 18:1 and 5:1.",
    "CPF-13 achieves strong CO2/N2 selectivity: 35:1 at 273 K and 0.1 bar, 31:1 at 273 K and 1 bar, but only 9.5:1 at 298 K and 0.15 bar."
